{"seq":1,"slug":"hilt-fundamentals","title":"Hilt 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/hilt-fundamentals","wordCount":641,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"hilt-基础\">Hilt 基础</h1><p>Hilt 是 Google 推荐的 Android 依赖注入框架，建立在 Dagger 之上，为 Android 应用提供标准化的 DI 方案。Hilt 自动生成 Dagger 组件和组件层级，大幅简化了配置工作。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hilt 的体系由四个核心概念构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>@HiltAndroidApp</code></strong>：注解 Application 类，触发代码生成，是整个依赖图的根节点。</li>\n<li><strong><code>@AndroidEntryPoint</code></strong>：让 Activity、Fragment、Service 等 Android 组件成为注入点。</li>\n<li><strong><code>@Inject</code> 与绑定</strong>：自有类用构造函数 <code>@Inject</code>，接口和第三方类用 Module 中的 <code>@Binds</code> / <code>@Provides</code> 提供。</li>\n<li><strong>组件层级与作用域</strong>：Hilt 生成与 Android 生命周期对齐的标准组件层级（SingletonComponent → ActivityRetainedComponent / ActivityComponent → FragmentComponent …），子组件可访问父组件的绑定。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"hiltandroidapp\">@HiltAndroidApp</h2><p><code>@HiltAndroidApp</code> 注解标记 Application 类，触发 Hilt 的代码生成，创建应用级别的依赖容器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltAndroidApp&#10;class MyApplication : Application() {&#10;    override fun onCreate() {&#10;        super.onCreate()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltAndroidApp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MyApplication : Application() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Hilt 的初始化流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;@HiltAndroidApp&quot;] --&gt; B[生成 SingletonComponent]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Application.onCreate]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;@AndroidEntryPoint Activity&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[生成 ActivityComponent]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;@AndroidEntryPoint Fragment&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[生成 FragmentComponent]&#10;&#10;    classDef hiltStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,D,F hiltStyle\">graph TD\n    A[\"@HiltAndroidApp\"] --&gt; B[生成 SingletonComponent]\n    B --&gt; C[Application.onCreate]\n    C --&gt; D[\"@AndroidEntryPoint Activity\"]\n    D --&gt; E[生成 ActivityComponent]\n    E --&gt; F[\"@AndroidEntryPoint Fragment\"]\n    F --&gt; G[生成 FragmentComponent]\n\n    classDef hiltStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,D,F hiltStyle</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>@HiltAndroidApp</code> 必须注解在 Application 类上，它是整个 Hilt 依赖图的根节点。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"androidentrypoint\">@AndroidEntryPoint</h2><p><code>@AndroidEntryPoint</code> 注解使 Android 组件（Activity、Fragment、Service 等）支持依赖注入。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@AndroidEntryPoint&#10;class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {&#10;&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;        setContent {&#10;            MyApp()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@AndroidEntryPoint&#10;class SyncService : Service() {&#10;&#10;    @Inject&#10;    lateinit var syncRepository: SyncRepository&#10;&#10;    override fun onBind(intent: Intent?): IBinder? = null&#10;&#10;    override fun onStartCommand(intent: Intent?, flags: Int, startId: Int): Int {&#10;        CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.IO).launch {&#10;            syncRepository.performSync()&#10;            stopSelf()&#10;        }&#10;        return START_NOT_STICKY&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@AndroidEntryPoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            MyApp()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@AndroidEntryPoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SyncService : Service() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Inject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lateinit var syncRepository: SyncRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onBind(intent: Intent?): IBinder? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onStartCommand(intent: Intent?, flags: Int, startId: Int): Int {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.IO).launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            syncRepository.performSync()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            stopSelf()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return START_NOT_STICKY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>支持 <code>@AndroidEntryPoint</code> 的组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件类型</th>\n<th>基类要求</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Activity</code></td>\n<td><code>ComponentActivity</code></td>\n<td>最常用的注入点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Fragment</code></td>\n<td><code>Fragment</code>（AndroidX）</td>\n<td>必须附着于 <code>@AndroidEntryPoint</code> Activity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>View</code></td>\n<td><code>View</code></td>\n<td>必须在注入的 Fragment/Activity 中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Service</code></td>\n<td><code>Service</code></td>\n<td>后台服务注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BroadcastReceiver</code></td>\n<td><code>BroadcastReceiver</code></td>\n<td>广播接收器注入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"inject\">@Inject</h2><p><code>@Inject</code> 注解用于构造函数注入和字段注入两种方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleRepository @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val api: ArticleApi,&#10;    private val dao: ArticleDao,&#10;    private val dispatcher: CoroutineDispatcher&#10;) {&#10;    suspend fun getArticles(): List&lt;Article&gt; = withContext(dispatcher) {&#10;        try {&#10;            val remote = api.fetchArticles()&#10;            dao.insertArticles(remote.map { it.toEntity() })&#10;            remote&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            dao.getAllArticles().first().map { it.toDomain() }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class AnalyticsTracker @Inject constructor(&#10;    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context,&#10;    private val preferences: DataStore&lt;Preferences&gt;&#10;) {&#10;    fun trackEvent(name: String, params: Map&lt;String, String&gt; = emptyMap()) {&#10;        // 追踪事件&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleRepository @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val api: ArticleApi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dao: ArticleDao,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dispatcher: CoroutineDispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getArticles(): List&#x3C;Article> = withContext(dispatcher) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val remote = api.fetchArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dao.insertArticles(remote.map { it.toEntity() })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            remote</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dao.getAllArticles().first().map { it.toDomain() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AnalyticsTracker @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val preferences: DataStore&#x3C;Preferences></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun trackEvent(name: String, params: Map&#x3C;String, String> = emptyMap()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 追踪事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>构造函数注入 vs 字段注入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>可测试性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构造函数注入</td>\n<td><code>class Foo @Inject constructor(val bar: Bar)</code></td>\n<td>自有类</td>\n<td>高（直接传参）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段注入</td>\n<td><code>@Inject lateinit var bar: Bar</code></td>\n<td>Android 组件</td>\n<td>中（需 Hilt 初始化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"module-与-binding\">Module 与 Binding</h2><p>当无法使用构造函数注入时（如接口、第三方库类），需要通过 Module 提供绑定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;abstract class RepositoryModule {&#10;&#10;    @Binds&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    abstract fun bindArticleRepository(&#10;        impl: ArticleRepositoryImpl&#10;    ): ArticleRepository&#10;&#10;    @Binds&#10;    abstract fun bindAnalyticsService(&#10;        impl: FirebaseAnalyticsService&#10;    ): AnalyticsService&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object NetworkModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideOkHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {&#10;        return OkHttpClient.Builder()&#10;            .connectTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)&#10;            .readTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)&#10;            .addInterceptor(HttpLoggingInterceptor().apply {&#10;                level = HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.BODY&#10;            })&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideRetrofit(okHttpClient: OkHttpClient): Retrofit {&#10;        return Retrofit.Builder()&#10;            .baseUrl(&quot;https://api.example.com/&quot;)&#10;            .client(okHttpClient)&#10;            .addConverterFactory(Json.asConverterFactory(&quot;application/json&quot;.toMediaType()))&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideArticleApi(retrofit: Retrofit): ArticleApi {&#10;        return retrofit.create(ArticleApi::class.java)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class RepositoryModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Binds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun bindArticleRepository(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        impl: ArticleRepositoryImpl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): ArticleRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Binds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun bindAnalyticsService(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        impl: FirebaseAnalyticsService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): AnalyticsService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object NetworkModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideOkHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return OkHttpClient.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .connectTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .readTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addInterceptor(HttpLoggingInterceptor().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                level = HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.BODY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideRetrofit(okHttpClient: OkHttpClient): Retrofit {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Retrofit.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .baseUrl(\"https://api.example.com/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .client(okHttpClient)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addConverterFactory(Json.asConverterFactory(\"application/json\".toMediaType()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideArticleApi(retrofit: Retrofit): ArticleApi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return retrofit.create(ArticleApi::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>@Binds</code> vs <code>@Provides</code> 对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>@Binds</th>\n<th>@Provides</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>接口绑定到实现</td>\n<td>提供实例创建逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module 类型</td>\n<td><code>abstract class</code></td>\n<td><code>object</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方法类型</td>\n<td><code>abstract fun</code></td>\n<td>普通 <code>fun</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现类要求</td>\n<td>必须有 <code>@Inject</code> 构造函数</td>\n<td>无要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效率</td>\n<td>更高（不生成额外代码）</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"组件层级\">组件层级</h2><p>Hilt 定义了标准的组件层级结构，每个组件对应一个 Android 类的作用域。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SingletonComponent] --&gt; B[ActivityRetainedComponent]&#10;    B --&gt; C[ViewModelComponent]&#10;    B --&gt; D[ActivityComponent]&#10;    D --&gt; E[FragmentComponent]&#10;    D --&gt; F[ViewComponent]&#10;    E --&gt; G[ViewWithFragmentComponent]&#10;    A --&gt; H[ServiceComponent]&#10;&#10;    classDef singletonStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef activityStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A singletonStyle&#10;    class D,E activityStyle\">graph TD\n    A[SingletonComponent] --&gt; B[ActivityRetainedComponent]\n    B --&gt; C[ViewModelComponent]\n    B --&gt; D[ActivityComponent]\n    D --&gt; E[FragmentComponent]\n    D --&gt; F[ViewComponent]\n    E --&gt; G[ViewWithFragmentComponent]\n    A --&gt; H[ServiceComponent]\n\n    classDef singletonStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef activityStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A singletonStyle\n    class D,E activityStyle</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用域注解</th>\n<th>创建时机</th>\n<th>销毁时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>SingletonComponent</code></td>\n<td><code>@Singleton</code></td>\n<td><code>Application.onCreate</code></td>\n<td><code>Application.onTerminate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ActivityRetainedComponent</code></td>\n<td><code>@ActivityRetainedScoped</code></td>\n<td>Activity 首次创建</td>\n<td>Activity 最终销毁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ViewModelComponent</code></td>\n<td><code>@ViewModelScoped</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel 创建</td>\n<td>ViewModel 清除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ActivityComponent</code></td>\n<td><code>@ActivityScoped</code></td>\n<td><code>Activity.onCreate</code></td>\n<td><code>Activity.onDestroy</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FragmentComponent</code></td>\n<td><code>@FragmentScoped</code></td>\n<td><code>Fragment.onAttach</code></td>\n<td><code>Fragment.onDestroy</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ServiceComponent</code></td>\n<td><code>@ServiceScoped</code></td>\n<td><code>Service.onCreate</code></td>\n<td><code>Service.onDestroy</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Module&#10;@InstallIn(ViewModelComponent::class)&#10;object ViewModelModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @ViewModelScoped&#10;    fun provideUseCase(repository: ArticleRepository): GetArticlesUseCase {&#10;        return GetArticlesUseCase(repository)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(ViewModelComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object ViewModelModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ViewModelScoped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideUseCase(repository: ArticleRepository): GetArticlesUseCase {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return GetArticlesUseCase(repository)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 子组件可以访问父组件中绑定的依赖，但反过来不行。例如 <code>FragmentComponent</code> 可以使用 <code>@Singleton</code> 的绑定。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>@HiltAndroidApp</code> 标记 Application 类，是 Hilt 依赖图的根节点</li>\n<li><code>@AndroidEntryPoint</code> 使 Android 组件支持依赖注入</li>\n<li>构造函数 <code>@Inject</code> 注入适用于自有类，<code>@Provides</code> / <code>@Binds</code> 适用于接口和第三方类</li>\n<li><code>@Binds</code> 绑定接口到实现，<code>@Provides</code> 提供实例创建逻辑</li>\n<li>Hilt 组件层级与 Android 生命周期对齐，子组件可访问父组件的绑定</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hilt 基础","id":"hilt-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"@HiltAndroidApp","id":"hiltandroidapp"},{"level":2,"text":"@AndroidEntryPoint","id":"androidentrypoint"},{"level":2,"text":"@Inject","id":"inject"},{"level":2,"text":"Module 与 Binding","id":"module-与-binding"},{"level":2,"text":"组件层级","id":"组件层级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WorkManager 后台任务管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/workmanager"},"next":{"title":"作用域与绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/scopes-and-bindings"}}